## 4. Login Test Cases – BookMyShow-style App

| TC ID    | Scenario                        | Test Steps                                                                                                                                       | Expected Result                                                                                   | Actual Result                                             |
| -------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| **TC01** | Positive – Valid Login          | 1. Open the app. 2. Enter a registered mobile number/email. 3. Enter correct password/OTP. 4. Click **Login**.                                   | User should successfully log in and reach the home screen.                                        | **Passed** – User logged in successfully.                 |
| **TC02** | Negative – Invalid Password     | 1. Open Login page. 2. Enter a registered email/mobile number. 3. Enter an incorrect password. 4. Click **Login**.                               | Login should be rejected and a suitable error message should be displayed.                        | **Passed** – Error message was displayed.                 |
| **TC03** | Boundary – Maximum Input Length | 1. Open Login page. 2. Enter the maximum allowed number of characters in the email/mobile field. 3. Enter valid credentials. 4. Click **Login**. | Application should accept the allowed maximum length and should not crash or behave unexpectedly. | **Passed** – Maximum allowed input was handled correctly. |

